#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1319
#, kde-format
msgid "Pick one based on the GPUs in your system"
msgstr "根据系统中的 GPU 选择一项"

#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1325
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Intel only or paired with another vendor GPU:<br>- FFmpeg + VA-API "
"acceleration backend + iHD VA-API driver<br>- FFmpeg + Quick Sync "
"acceleration backend<br>- FFmpeg + Vulkan acceleration backend if Intel is "
"the primary renderer or the other GPU does not support it"
msgstr ""
"仅 Intel 或与其他厂商 GPU 搭配：<br>- FFmpeg + VA-API 加速后端 + iHD VA-API "
"驱动<br>- FFmpeg + Quick Sync 加速后端<br>- 如果 Intel 是主渲染器或其他 GPU "
"不支持，则使用 FFmpeg + Vulkan 加速后端"

#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1331
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"AMD only or paired with another vendor GPU:<br>- FFmpeg + VA-API "
"acceleration backend + radeonsi VA-API driver<br>- FFmpeg + Vulkan "
"acceleration backend if AMD is the primary renderer or the other GPU does "
"not support it"
msgstr ""
"仅 AMD 或与其他厂商 GPU 搭配：<br>- FFmpeg + VA-API 加速后端 + radeonsi VA-"
"API 驱动<br>- 如果 AMD 是主渲染器或其他 GPU 不支持，则使用 FFmpeg + Vulkan 加"
"速后端"

#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1337
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"NVIDIA only or paired with another vendor GPU:<br>- FFmpeg + cuda "
"acceleration backend<br>- FFmpeg + Vulkan acceleration backend if NVIDIA is "
"the primary renderer or the other GPU does not support it"
msgstr ""
"仅 NVIDIA 或与其他厂商 GPU 搭配：<br>- FFmpeg + CUDA 加速后端<br>- 如果 "
"NVIDIA 是主渲染器或其他 GPU 不支持，则使用 FFmpeg + Vulkan 加速后端"

#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1359
#, kde-format
msgid "Media backend:"
msgstr "媒体后端："

#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1362 package/contents/ui/config.qml:1390
#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1407 package/contents/ui/config.qml:1468
#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1479 package/contents/ui/config.qml:1497
#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1508 package/contents/ui/config.qml:1526
#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1562
#, kde-format
msgid "System default"
msgstr "系统默认"

#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1368
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"By default Qt will use the FFmpeg backend, if it causes playback issues in "
"your system try switching to the GStreamer backend instead.<br><br>Make sure "
"you have both backends installed in your system, on Arch the packages are "
"<strong>qt6-multimedia-ffmpeg</strong> and <strong>qt6-multimedia-gstreamer</"
"strong>"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下 Qt 将使用 FFmpeg 后端。如果它在您的系统中导致播放问题，请尝试切换"
"到 GStreamer 后端。<br><br>请确保系统中已安装这两个后端。在 Arch 上，对应的软"
"件包为<strong>qt6-multimedia-ffmpeg</strong>和<strong>qt6-multimedia-"
"gstreamer</strong>。"

