#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1433
#, kde-format
msgid "NVIDIA, Intel and AMD, needs GPU and driver support"
msgstr "NVIDIA、Intel 和 AMD，需要 GPU 和驱动支持"

#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1462
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You can use this to force a specific gpu, for example by setting "
"<strong>vaapi</strong> to use an integrated Intel/AMD gpu instead of a "
"dedicated NVIDIA gpu, which normally uses <strong>cuda</strong>.<br><br>It's "
"important to note that this may not work with some setups, create an issue "
"on GitHub or ping me on the Discord server if you need help."
msgstr ""
"您可以用此选项强制指定 GPU。例如设置为<strong>vaapi</strong>以使用 Intel/AMD "
"集成 GPU，而不是通常使用<strong>cuda</strong>的 NVIDIA 独立 GPU。<br><br>请注"
"意，这在某些配置下可能无法工作。如需帮助，请在 GitHub 上提交 issue 或在 "
"Discord 服务器上联系我。"

#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1476
#, kde-format
msgid "VA-API driver:"
msgstr "VA-API 驱动："

#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1491
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Select the VA-API driver to use. See the link at the top of this section for "
"the required system packages."
msgstr "选择要使用的 VA-API 驱动。有关所需的系统软件包，请参阅本节顶部的链接。"

