#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1520
#, kde-format
msgid "NVIDIA (and older AMD) not recommended or supported on modern hardware"
msgstr "不建议在现代硬件上使用 NVIDIA（及旧版 AMD），不受支持"

#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1534
#, kde-format
msgid "Disable hardware textures conversion:"
msgstr "禁用硬件纹理转换："

#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:1551
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"GPU-based conversion for decoded and rendered video frames can significantly "
"reduce CPU usage.<br>It is recommended to keep this disabled (unchecked) "
"unless you encounter rendering issues like <a href='%1'>#104</a>, or log "
"spam like the following:<br><code>eglCreateImage failed for plane 0 with "
"error code 12300</code><br><code>vaExportSurfaceHandle failed</code>"
msgstr ""
"基于 GPU 的已解码和渲染视频帧转换可显著降低 CPU 占用。<br>建议保持此选项为禁"
"用（未勾选），除非遇到<a href='%1'>#104</a>等渲染问题，或出现以下日志刷屏："
"<br><code>eglCreateImage failed for plane 0 with error code 12300</"
"code><br><code>vaExportSurfaceHandle failed</code>"

